WEBVTT

00:13:59.632 --> 00:14:01.520
and less linguistic imperialism.

00:14:01.949 --> 00:14:04.933
Maybe if we actually respect
language for what it is --

00:14:04.957 --> 00:14:09.849
literally, the greatest invention
in the history of humankind --

00:14:09.873 --> 00:14:11.079
then in the future,

00:14:11.103 --> 00:14:14.992
we can celebrate endangered languages
as living languages,

00:14:15.016 --> 00:14:16.683
as opposed to museum pieces.

00:14:17.182 --> 00:14:18.968
(High Valyrian) Kirimvose.
Thank you.

00:14:18.992 --> 00:14:20.388
(Applause)